                "retweet_count": 208,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans are lying\u2014here\u2019s the truth.\n\nThe Republican budget means that healthcare premiums will MORE THAN DOUBLE next year for millions of Americans.\n\nThey claim Democrats want undocumented immigrants to get Medicare & Medicaid. That is a PROPOSTEROUS LIE. They know that is already illegal under federal law, and they are lying to turn this into a debate about something that does not happen.\n\nHere\u2019s the question they REFUSE to answer: WHO IS ACTUALLY HURT IF THEIR BUDGET PASSES?\n\nAnswer: THE AMERICAN PEOPLE!\n\nThat is their strategy. Lie, deflect, and distract you with BS about immigrants to turn your attention away from the fact that they don\u2019t think working families deserve affordable healthcare. It\u2019s sick.",
